    "objetivo": "Replace a direct object with «lo, la, li, le» and the other direct object pronouns, put them in the right place and make the participle agree in the passato prossimo. Avoid the English-speaker traps: putting the pronoun after the verb, not agreeing the participle, and mixing direct and indirect pronouns.",
